    oeq:q_psoriatic_arthritis_safety oe:answerText "We report the long-term safety of upadacitinib (oral, selective, and reversible Janus kinase inhibitor) in rheumatoid arthritis (RA), psoriatic arthritis (PsA), ankylosing spondylitis (AS), non-radiographic axial spondyloarthritis (nr-axSpA), atopic dermatitis (AD), Crohn's disease (CD), and ulcerative colitis (UC). Data were analyzed from 16 studies (data cutoff August 15, 2024)."^^xsd:string ;
