    oeq:q_stroke_efficacy oe:answerText "Minocycline has been reported as a multi-target anti-neuroinflammatory drug with potential benefits for ischaemic stroke in preclinical models and small-scale clinical studies. The EMPHASIS trial was designed to provide robust evidence regarding its efficacy and safety in patients with acute ischaemic stroke."^^xsd:string ;
        oe:cites oesrc:41376587,
