    oeq:q_acute_kidney_injury_treatment oe:answerText "The effect of sodium bicarbonate infusion on outcome in patients with severe metabolic acidemia and moderate to severe acute kidney injury is unknown. To determine whether sodium bicarbonate infusion is associated with day 90 all-cause mortality in patients with severe metabolic acidemia and moderate to severe acute kidney injury."^^xsd:string ;
