    oedrug:escitalopram oe:treats oed:generalized_anxiety_disorder .

    oeq:q_generalized_anxiety_disorder_efficacy oe:answerText "Beta-blocker prescriptions for patients with anxiety increased substantially between 2003 and 2018, yet there is no clinical guidance concerning their use. A previous review of propranolol - a beta-blocker - in the treatment of anxiety concluded there was insufficient evidence to support its use."^^xsd:string ;
